∇ UnitTests;r;d;e;t;f
 ⍝ detectDateFormat
  'dates: day>12 means DD/MM'({1≡##.detectDateFormat ⍵}Check)'01/02/2026 - 13/02/2026'
  'dates: month position>12 means MM/DD'({0≡##.detectDateFormat ⍵}Check)'02/01/2026 - 02/13/2026'
  'dates: both seen is an error'({'INCONSISTENT Dates'≡DateError ⍵}Check)'13/02/2026 02/13/2026'
  'dates: all ≤12 is ambiguous'({'AMBIGUOUS'≡DateError ⍵}Check)'01/02/2026 - 03/04/2026'
  'dates: none found'({'NO_DATES'≡DateError ⍵}Check)'nothing here'

 ⍝ The reference model's own date-format detection
  'reference dates: day>12 means DD/MM'({1≡RefDates ⍵}Check)'01/02/2026' '13/02/2026'
  'reference dates: month position>12 means MM/DD'({0≡RefDates ⍵}Check)'02/01/2026' '02/13/2026'
  'reference dates: impossible date is refused'({0::1 ⋄ 0⊣RefDates ⍵}Check)'31/02/2026' '13/02/2026'

 ⍝ ical on a hand-built course. Values must be copied literally: before b49f517
 ⍝ an & in a course name was read by ⎕R as "the matched text" ('A @name B').
  r←⊂'TTh' '8:30AM' '9:50AM' '05/01/2026' '16/01/2026' 'LEC' 'Alder Birch'
  r,←⊂(,'F')'13:30' '14:20' '09/01/2026' '09/01/2026' 'TUT'TBA
  r,←⊂'' '' '' '05/01/2026' '16/01/2026' 'LAB'TBA      ⍝ no time: not exported
  d←' | Signals & Systems @prof \0 / '
  e←⊂'2026-01-06 Tue 08:30-09:50 | ECE 100 LEC',d,'Alder Birch'
  e,←⊂'2026-01-08 Thu 08:30-09:50 | ECE 100 LEC',d,'Alder Birch'
  e,←⊂'2026-01-09 Fri 13:30-14:20 | ECE 100 TUT',d,TBA
  e,←⊂'2026-01-13 Tue 08:30-09:50 | ECE 100 LEC',d,'Alder Birch'
  e,←⊂'2026-01-15 Thu 08:30-09:50 | ECE 100 LEC',d,'Alder Birch'
  t←'@code @type' '@name / @prof'
  'ical: hand-built course, DD/MM'({(Lines e)Diff Events(t,1)##.ical 1 HandBuilt ⍵}Check)r
  'ical: hand-built course, MM/DD'({(Lines e)Diff Events(t,0)##.ical 0 HandBuilt ⍵}Check)r
  'ical: output follows RFC 5545'({RfcProblems(t,1)##.ical 1 HandBuilt ⍵}Check)r
  r←⊂(,'M')'12:30PM' '1:20PM' '12/01/2026' '12/01/2026' 'LEC'TBA
  r,←⊂(,'W')'12:30AM' '1:20AM' '14/01/2026' '14/01/2026' 'LEC'TBA
  r,←⊂(,'F')'11:30AM' '12:20PM' '16/01/2026' '16/01/2026' 'LEC'TBA
  e←'2026-01-12 Mon 12:30-13:20' '2026-01-14 Wed 00:30-01:20' '2026-01-16 Fri 11:30-12:20'
  e←e,¨⊂' | ECE 100 LEC | ',TBA
  'ical: 12 o''clock in 12h times'({(Lines e)Diff Events('@code @type' '@prof' 1)##.ical 1 HandBuilt ⍵}Check)r
  r←⊂(,'S')'10:30' '11:20' '05/01/2026' '18/01/2026' 'LEC'TBA     ⍝ S = Saturday, Su = Sunday
  r,←⊂'Su' '10:30' '11:20' '05/01/2026' '18/01/2026' 'TUT'TBA
  e←'2026-01-10 Sat' '2026-01-11 Sun' '2026-01-17 Sat' '2026-01-18 Sun'
  e←e,¨(⊂' 10:30-11:20 | ECE 100 '),¨'LEC' 'TUT' 'LEC' 'TUT',¨⊂' | ',TBA
  'ical: weekend classes'({(Lines e)Diff Events('@code @type' '@prof' 1)##.ical 1 HandBuilt ⍵}Check)r
 
 ⍝ The test helpers must accept a correct calendar, or fixing ical won't make tests pass
  'helpers: IcsEvents reads a valid calendar'({(Lines ValidEvents)Diff Events ⍵}Check)ValidIcs
  'helpers: RfcProblems accepts a valid calendar'(RfcProblems Check)ValidIcs
  'helpers: RfcProblems flags a local UNTIL'({∨/'UNTIL must be in UTC'⍷RfcProblems ⍵}Check)('UNTIL=20260314T045900Z'⎕R'UNTIL=20260313T235900')ValidIcs
 
 ⍝ uwsch on a case no fixture has
  :If ⎕NEXISTS f←FixtureDir,'winter2026-mmdd-12h-crlf-plain.txt'
      'uwsch: three instructors split over three lines'(ThreeInstructors Check)ReadRaw f
  :EndIf

 ⍝ The anonymiser itself, on synthetic personal data planted in a fixture
  :If 0<≢Fixtures
      'anonymise: removes planted names'(AnonymiserTest Check)⊃Fixtures
  :EndIf
∇
